                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Victory Road. Every challenger for the last badge threads this canyon, and I stand its mouth. I saw you from the ridge above - a straight run like this hides nobody. Prove you belong on the Road."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "There are three harder than me strung up the pass, and the Fire gym at the summit after that. I am the gentle start. Do not waste it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You move like the sealed files, the ones the Company keeps under a black bar. I only ask the mountain kind of question - on the field, right now."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Ronan Peakguard",
                    Label: "default"
                }
            ]
